; The running example of docs/languages/btor2.md §2.1: an 8-bit counter that
; starts at 0, increments each step, and is bad when it reaches 200.
1 sort bitvec 1
2 sort bitvec 8
3 constd 2 0
4 input 2 x
5 state 2 counter
6 init 2 5 3
7 constd 2 1
8 add 2 5 7
9 next 2 5 8
10 constd 2 200
11 eq 1 5 10
12 bad 11
